@title 3D view: select a device and duplicate it, then undo
@area 3D
@sizes 1366x768
# Fixed 1366x768 window points: the cube front face (1295,124) and K1 (550,393) are where the front view puts them at that size.
open_starter_example
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
click 1295 124
wait 40
click 550 393
wait 20
key ctrl+d
wait 30
expect "CAB-K2"
shot duplicated
key ctrl+z
wait 30
expect_not "CAB-K2"
shot undone
check_layout
